        <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Most browsers allow you to control, block, or delete cookies through browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect certain website functionality. You can also turn Analytics and Marketing cookies for this site on or off directly on our <a href="/cookie-preferences/" class="font-medium text-sky-600 underline decoration-sky-200 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-[#5a9100]">Cookie Preferences</a> page.</p>
